==Battleground==
*5 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 93.33~96.67 seconds<sup>2,800f~2,900f</sup>.
*10 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The two Ursamajors are the main threats, as they constantly impose damage on your cats while preventing Crustaceous Scissorex from being hit. Use something that outranges Ursamajor or can take a severe amount of hits from it to kill the first Ursamajor as soon as possible, as two Ursamajors stacked up can be annoying. Once both Ursamajors are dead, the stage is free.

It is recommended to have at least all [[anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] up to and including CotC 2 before attempting this stage otherwise the General GreGory will become too much of a threat.

